---
const groups=[['surface','Surface padding','Base padding for cards, panels, dialogs and drawers'],['control','Control padding','Multiplier for button and field padding'],['spacing','Content spacing','Base gaps and spacing between content']];
---
<section id="custom-density-editor" hidden aria-labelledby="custom-density-title">
  <h3 id="custom-density-title">Your spacing</h3>
  <p>Set base surface padding and content spacing in rem. Control padding uses a multiplier: 1 follows the comfortable preset. Cards scale base surface padding by 1.5. Minimum control heights stay in place.</p>
  <label><input id="density-linked" type="checkbox" checked/>Link all three values</label>
  <div class="density-fields">
    {groups.map(([key,title,description])=><div class="density-field">
      <label for={`density-${key}-number`}>{title} <small>{description}</small></label>
      <div class="density-controls">
        <input id={`density-${key}-range`} type="range" min="0" max="4" step="0.05" value="1" data-density-key={key} aria-label={`${title} slider ${key==='control'?'multiplier':'in rem'}`}/>
        <div><input id={`density-${key}-number`} type="number" min="0" max="10" step="any" value="1" data-density-key={key} aria-describedby={`density-${key}-unit`}/><span id={`density-${key}-unit`}>{key==='control'?'×':'rem'}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>)}
  </div>
  <div class="density-preview" data-density="custom" aria-label="Custom density preview">
    <article class="card stack"><h4>Your surface</h4><label for="density-preview-field">Your field</label><input id="density-preview-field" placeholder="Preview your spacing"/><div class="row"><button type="button">Your action</button><span class="badge">Badge</span></div></article>
  </div>
  <div class="row"><button id="export-custom-density" type="button">Export density CSS</button><button id="copy-custom-density" type="button" class="outline">Copy density CSS</button></div>
  <div class="accordion"><details class="configuration-summary"><summary>View density CSS</summary><pre tabindex="0" aria-label="Custom density CSS"><code id="custom-density-css"></code></pre></details></div>
  <p>Use Density → Custom on your page or a parent. Downloaded starting HTML includes your values. Local density presets keep their own spacing.</p>
</section>
<style>
#custom-density-editor { margin-block:1rem; padding:1rem; border:1px solid var(--re-line); border-radius:var(--re-radius); }
#custom-density-title { font-size:1.05rem; margin-block:0 .5rem; }
#custom-density-editor > p { font-size:.85rem; }
.density-fields { display:grid; gap:1rem; margin-block:1rem; }
.density-field label { margin:0; }
.density-field small { display:block; font-weight:400; color:var(--re-muted); }
.density-controls { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(6rem,8rem); gap:1rem; align-items:center; }
.density-controls > div { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.4rem; min-inline-size:0; }
.density-controls input { min-inline-size:0; }
.density-preview { margin-block:1rem; }
.density-preview h4 { margin:0; }
@media (width < 23rem) { .density-controls { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:.25rem; } }
</style>
